  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2026 oPt Emergency Appeal - West Bank - Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRWA will support 15,000 displaced households (75,000 individuals) with emergency multipurpose cash assistance (EMPCA) to help them meet their most urgent basic needs through a flexible and dignified modality. This support will help prevent negative coping mechanisms, including food reduction, debt accrual and the withdrawal of children from school for labour purposes. The cash modality will also contribute to community resilience by strengthening demand for goods and services in local markets.</narrative>
  </description>
